      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "Using a calculator, find the value of $\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{2}{3})+\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{1}{2})$ in degrees to the nearest degree.",
      "worked_solution": "Using a calculator, we find \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{2}{3})+\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{1}{2}) & =(41.810…)^{∘}+(26.565…)^{∘} \\\\  & =(68.375…)^{∘} \\\\  & ≈{68}^{∘}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nrounded to the nearest degree.",
