    "q-27912": {
      "dom_id": "step-q27912",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "If $\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta =0.25$ and $\\theta $ is acute, then the value of $\\theta $ in degrees to one decimal place is",
      "worked_solution": "To find $\\theta $ we use $arctan.$ We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta  & =0.25 \\\\ \\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta ) & =\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(0.25) \\\\ \\theta  & =\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(0.25).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing a calculator, we find\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\theta  & =\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(0.25). \\\\  & =(14.036\\,2…)^{∘} \\\\  & ≈{14.0}^{∘}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nrounded to one decimal place.",
